{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s02e01-scene-10",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "とにかく進めてください、全速力で  (Move Forward at Full Speed)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kacho": "課長",
    "muranishi": "村西"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Arriving at the satellite uplink station, Muranishi gazes up in awe at towering white dishes beaming television waves into orbit and tells the bank Section Chief to charge ahead at full speed. Listen for \"zensokuryoku\", full speed.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "あれですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すごすぎる。何だ、これは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "今世の中は宇宙時代に突入していましてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ここから電波が飛ぶんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "そうです。この巨大アンテナから飛んだ電波を衛星がキャッチするんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "そして今度は衛星から地球に電波が降り注ぐ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "それを受信することで放送が見られる仕組みですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "村西さん、聞いてますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ええ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "衛星放送のチャンネルを一つ持てば、何でも好きに放送できるんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "説明はもういいです。とにかく進めてください、全速力で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "かしこまりました。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "あれですよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right over there—that is it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "すごすぎる。何だ、これは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unbelievable. What on earth is this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "今世の中は宇宙時代に突入していましてね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The world is entering the space age right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ここから電波が飛ぶんですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Radio signals fly into space right from here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "そうです。この巨大アンテナから飛んだ電波を衛星がキャッチするんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That's right. Orbiting satellites catch the waves beamed from these giant antennas.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "そして今度は衛星から地球に電波が降り注ぐ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And then the signals shower back down from the satellite onto the earth.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "それを受信することで放送が見られる仕組みですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By receiving those signals, viewers can watch the broadcast anywhere.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "村西さん、聞いてますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Muranishi, are you listening?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ええ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, every word.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "衛星放送のチャンネルを一つ持てば、何でも好きに放送できるんです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you hold just one satellite channel, you can broadcast whatever you please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "説明はもういいです。とにかく進めてください、全速力で。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Enough explanation. Just push this forward at full speed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "かしこまりました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Certainly, sir.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
